  "question": {
    "text": "A graph plotted between <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></math> vs log concentration is a straight line. What conclusion can you draw from the given graph?<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0082_59451003cf1c.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 146px;\" /><br />\r<br />\r[Given: n = order of reaction]"
